<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>NSPrivacyTracking</key>
	<false/>
	<key>NSPrivacyTrackingDomains</key>
	<array/>
	<key>NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypes</key>
	<array/>
	<key>NSPrivacyAccessedAPITypes</key>
	<array>
		<!--
		NSPrivacyAccessedAPICategoryUserDefaults — CA92.1, not 1C8F.1.

		Every UserDefaults call in the app (AppModel's attached-store registry,
		CaptureLog, QuickCaptureDefault, VoiceCaptureLastTarget) goes through
		`UserDefaults.standard`. None of it uses
		`UserDefaults(suiteName: "group.com.phren.ios")` — the App Group
		entitlement exists only so the widget extension can read a JSON
		snapshot file from the shared container via
		`FileManager.containerURL(forSecurityApplicationGroupIdentifier:)`,
		which is not a UserDefaults access at all. 1C8F.1 (defaults shared
		across an App Group) would only apply if the app and widget actually
		shared a UserDefaults suite, which they don't — the widget can't link
		PhrenKit or the app target and never touches UserDefaults itself.
		CA92.1 (information accessible only to the app itself) is correct.

		NSPrivacyAccessedAPICategoryFileTimestamp — C617.1 and 0A2A.1.

		PhrenKit's LocalStore reads .contentModificationDateKey to tell a
		changed store file from an unchanged one before re-parsing it (C617.1:
		timestamps of files inside the app's own container). SwiftTerm, a
		linked package without a manifest of its own, calls stat/fstat on
		files it is handed (0A2A.1: a third-party SDK's declared reason,
		listed here because the SDK does not ship a manifest).

		No other required-reason category applies: nothing reads the system
		boot time (the terminal's reconnect clock is ContinuousClock), checks
		disk space, or enumerates active keyboards.
		-->
		<dict>
			<key>NSPrivacyAccessedAPIType</key>
			<string>NSPrivacyAccessedAPICategoryUserDefaults</string>
			<key>NSPrivacyAccessedAPITypeReasons</key>
			<array>
				<string>CA92.1</string>
			</array>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>NSPrivacyAccessedAPIType</key>
			<string>NSPrivacyAccessedAPICategoryFileTimestamp</string>
			<key>NSPrivacyAccessedAPITypeReasons</key>
			<array>
				<string>C617.1</string>
				<string>0A2A.1</string>
			</array>
		</dict>
	</array>
</dict>
</plist>
